<http://www.spektrix.com/improvcentrevancouver/event/64401AKMPPVDBDCMHSBTMJNCMMKKJJJDG>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Deadly Dinner Party";
  schema:description """
	<h2>A classic whodunnit of improvised proportions…</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://theimprovcentre.ca/seasonpass/\">Become a Season Pass Holder &amp; Save on this show!</a></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Five VIPs receive letters from an eccentric millionaire, summoning them to a mysterious dinner. When murder is served as the first course, a detective must interrogate each guest and solve the crime before it’s too late.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>When the host is murdered, suspicion falls on everyone at the table. Accusations fly, alibis unravel, and every new revelation sends the mystery in a completely unexpected direction. With every twist created on the spot, no two performances – and no two killers – are ever the same!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>A hilarious take on beloved whodunnits like Agatha Christie novels, Clue, and Knives Out – Deadly Dinner Party is a perfect way to usher in the most ominous season of the year.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Run time: 90 minutes including intermission<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Rated: 🌶️🌶️🌶️– Includes more references to romantic relationships. May include light fighting or references to violence. There may be references to smoking or drug use. Best for teens and up. (14A)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please Note: as The Improv Centre is a licensed facility, all minors (persons under the age of 19) must be accompanied by an adult.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-09-25T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
